#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:5
#: 4ee88533c5184f5eab1e2383456f666f
msgid "Editing the code with VSCode"
msgstr "使用 VSCode 编辑代码"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:7
#: 17fa77989f824d60a53749e5b4f2b930
msgid ""
"VSCode is free and available on all desktop platforms: Windows, Linux, "
"MacOS. VSCode can be downloaded from `here "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"VSCode 免费且适用于所有桌面平台：Windows、Linux、MacOS。VSCode 可在 `此处 "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ 下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:9
#: f57515c700504d99ad17214821fb29e4
msgid ""
"It bundles all tools need to build ArduPilot: C/C++ support, python support,"
" git support, and :ref:`debugging support <debugging-with-gdb-using-"
"vscode>`."
msgstr ""
"它集成了构建 ArduPilot 所需的所有工具：C/C++ 支持、Python 支持、git 支持以及 :ref:`调试支持 <debugging-"
"with-gdb-using-vscode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:11
#: cab1c205664540c59e68b657dafa8ddc
msgid ""
"For Windows 10 users, the Remote - WSL extension lets you use the Windows "
"Subsystem for Linux (WSL) as your full-time development environment right "
"from VS Code: https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/tutorials/wsl-"
"vscode"
msgstr ""
"对于 Windows 10 用户，Remote - WSL 扩展允许您直接在 VS Code 中使用 Windows Subsystem for "
"Linux (WSL) 作为全职开发环境：https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/wsl/tutorials/wsl-vscode"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:13
#: 5414b3b67aed44d4908086eabaa703ca
msgid ""
"For users that might want to collaborate on code using VSCode, `VSCode "
"provides a Live Share utility "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/learn/collaboration/live-share>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于希望使用 VSCode 协作编写代码的用户，`VSCode 提供了 Live Share 工具 "
"<https://code.visualstudio.com/learn/collaboration/live-share>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:17
#: b784dd81e2af463488e11e2379766a5f
msgid "ArduPilot VSCode Extension"
msgstr "ArduPilot VSCode 扩展"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-the-code-with-vscode.rst:19
#: 0d144885ea3848698f950dfb57ceed01
msgid ""
"There is an official ArduPilot VSCode extension that creates tasks on "
"demand. The marketplace page for the extension is `here "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=ardupilot-"
"org.ardupilot-devenv>`__. A video demonstrating using the extension is `here"
" <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PQMzclWC6u0>`__."
msgstr ""
"有一个官方的 ArduPilot VSCode 扩展，可按需创建任务。该扩展的市场页面在 `此处 "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=ardupilot-"
"org.ardupilot-devenv>`__。演示使用该扩展的视频在 `此处 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PQMzclWC6u0>`__。"
